    <!-- EN: Select expertise -->
  <VSE.SelectExpertise>選擇專精技能</VSE.SelectExpertise>
    <!-- EN: Selecting an expertise will unlock a new skill that your pawn will level up, granting them powerful, but very specific bonuses.\nYou can only select {0} expertise, and only in skills your pawns is passionate about. -->
  <VSE.ExpertiseDesc>當殖民者的某項技能達到15級，且熱情度較高（興趣、熱情、偏長或恃才）時，你可以為他們選擇一項屬性加成強力的專精技能。每名殖民者只能選擇{0}個專精技能，它們會像普通技能一樣出現在殖民者的「角色」面板裏。</VSE.ExpertiseDesc>
    <!-- EN: Your colonist has reached high enough level in a skill they are passionate about that they can gain expertise.\n\nConsider picking an expertise for them to gain new bonuses to the work type they are good at.\n\nColonists that can get expertise:\n\n -->
  <VSE.ExpertiseAvailableDesc>你的殖民者已有熱情度較高的技能達到了足夠等級，他們可以獲得一項新的專精技能了。打開殖民者的「角色」面板，點擊右上方的「★」按鈕即可進行選擇。\n\n專精技能選擇後將無法更改，因此請深思熟慮過後再做決定。\n\n以下殖民者有專精技能可用：\n\n</VSE.ExpertiseAvailableDesc>
    <!-- EN: \n   - Learns {0}\n   - Forgets {1} -->
  <VSE.LearnsForgets>\n   - 學習速度 {0}\n   - 遺忘速度 {1}</VSE.LearnsForgets>
