    <!-- EN: Good: -->
  <VSE.Good>【正面】熱情度</VSE.Good>
    <!-- EN: Allow expertise overlap -->
  <VSE.AllowExpertiseOverlap>殖民者的專精技能是否可以疊加</VSE.AllowExpertiseOverlap>
    <!-- EN: If false, then only 1 expertise can be chosen per skill, regardless of max expertise setting. -->
  <VSE.AllowExpertiseOverlap.Desc>如果禁用此項，則每個技能只能選擇一項專精（比如射擊達到15級後，選擇了瞄準專精就不能再選擇神射和裝填專精了）。此項僅在“殖民者最大專精技能數量”設置為2以上時生效。</VSE.AllowExpertiseOverlap.Desc>
    <!-- EN: Re-enable skill loss -->
  <VSE.EnableSkillLoss>重新啟用技能遺忘機製</VSE.EnableSkillLoss>
    <!-- EN: Enable "Expertise Available" alert -->
  <VSE.EnableAlert>啟用右下角“殖民者有專精技能可用”的提示</VSE.EnableAlert>
    <!-- EN: By default, Ducks' Insane Skills disables all skill loss. By selecting this option, this mod will override Ducks and enable it again. Use this if you still want to be able to take advantage of the forget speed changes in the new passions. -->
  <VSE.EnableSkillsLoss.Desc>默認狀況下，Ducks' Insane Skills會關掉原版的技能遺忘機製。啟用此項後，本mod將會通過覆蓋Ducks' Insane Skills的設置來達到再次啟用技能遺忘機製的目的。</VSE.EnableSkillsLoss.Desc>
	<!-- EN: Minimum skill to get an expertise -->
  <VSE.MinSkillForExpertise>解鎖專精技能所需的最小技能等級</VSE.MinSkillForExpertise>
	<!-- EN: The colonist will need to reach this skill level before being offered an expertise. -->
  <VSE.MinSkillForExpertiseDesc>殖民者的技能等級需要達到多少後，才可以解鎖對應的專精技能。</VSE.MinSkillForExpertiseDesc>
	<!-- EN: Expertise stat factor / offset multiplier -->
  <VSE.StatMultiplier>專精技能屬性系數/偏移乘數</VSE.StatMultiplier>
	<!-- EN: Is our balance too easy? Too hard? Go bitch on Reddit! Errrr... I mean, change it with this slider! The effects expertise have on stats will be multiplied by this number, so 0.1 will make expertise super weak, while 5 will make them incredibly overpowered. -->
  <VSE.StatMultiplierDesc>你覺得這個mod的平衡性搞得太簡單或太難了？那就試著通過此項來調整吧。專精技能的屬性加成將會乘以此項的值（乘數為0.1時加成極低，乘數為5時加成極高）。</VSE.StatMultiplierDesc>
	<!-- EN: Random passion chance in growth moments -->
  <VSE.GrowthMomentRandomPassions>成長時刻隨機獲得熱情度的幾率</VSE.GrowthMomentRandomPassions>
	<!-- EN: By default, 5% of the time a growth moment will select one of the skills that have no passions and assign either a Natural or an Apathy passion. -->
  <VSE.GrowthMomentRandomPassionsDesc>默認情況下，當殖民者到達新的成長時刻時，有5%的幾率會隨機選擇一項“無”熱情度的技能，並賦予其“恃才”或“乏味”熱情度。</VSE.GrowthMomentRandomPassionsDesc>
